sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Caller as CORE AI / Scheduler
    participant Intent as Trader Intent Registry
    participant MI as MI Application
    participant Clock as EvaluationClock
    participant Refs as Calendar + Instrument Master
    participant Obs as ObservationQueryPort
    participant Causal as Causal Selector + Manifest
    participant Quality as Quality Gate
    participant Bars as Bar / Finality Engine
    participant Features as Feature Engine
    participant Evidence as Dimension + Fusion Engines
    participant Context as Context Composer
    participant DB as MI Repository
    participant Outbox as Transactional Outbox
    participant Bus as Kafka Event Plane
    participant Consumers as CORE AI Consumers

    Caller->>Intent: Resolve active immutable intent reference
    Caller->>MI: Evaluate(contextKey, intentRef, analysisCutoff, knowledgeCutoff)
    MI->>Clock: Confirm deterministic evaluation time
    MI->>Refs: Resolve calendar, session, mappings, universe and active versions as known at cutoffs
    MI->>Obs: Query canonical observation revisions eligible for requested scope
    Obs-->>MI: Revisioned observations with eventTime, receivedAt and usableAt
    MI->>Causal: Select latest revision known at both cutoffs
    Causal-->>MI: Ordered content-addressed Input Manifest
    MI->>Quality: Evaluate hard gates, freshness, gaps, coverage and entitlement

    alt Invalid intent, lineage, session or mandatory quality gate
        Quality-->>MI: BLOCKED / SUSPENDED with explicit issues
        MI->>DB: Persist immutable abstained AnalysisRun
        MI-->>Caller: NO_CONTEXT with reason codes and manifest hash
    else Eligible or governed degraded mode
        Quality-->>MI: QualityAssessment and caps
        MI->>Bars: Build final session-aligned bars visible at cutoffs
        Bars-->>MI: Final bars, revisions, observedThrough and readyAt
        MI->>Features: Compute registered causal features
        Features-->>MI: FeatureSnapshot with readiness and versions
        MI->>Evidence: Produce typed dimension evidence and preserve contradiction
        Evidence-->>MI: Assessments, unknowns, support, opposition and confidence caps
        MI->>Context: Compose draft and semantic diff from prior version

        alt No material change
            Context-->>MI: NO_CHANGE
            MI->>DB: Persist AnalysisRun and materiality decision
            MI-->>Caller: Existing context reference plus evaluation trace
        else Publish, degrade, revalidate or invalidate
            Context-->>MI: Immutable MarketContext version and event fact
            MI->>DB: Begin transaction
            MI->>DB: Insert run, manifest, evidence, context and latest projection
            MI->>Outbox: Insert event using same transaction
            MI->>DB: Commit transaction
            Outbox->>Bus: Publish at least once, partitioned by Context Key
            Bus->>Consumers: MarketContext.Published / Degraded / Invalidated / Revalidated
            Consumers-->>Bus: Idempotent acknowledgment and checkpoint
            MI-->>Caller: Published context reference, decisionReadyAt and hashes
        end
    end

    opt Replay parity verification
        Caller->>MI: Re-evaluate same manifest, versions and virtual clock
        MI-->>Caller: Identical structured output hash within registered tolerance
    end
